{"category":"appointment|billing|medical_query|complaint|other","urgency":"high|medium|low","summary":"one short line"}
category: appointment=bookings, billing=payments/fees, medical_query=health questions, complaint=complaint, else other. urgency: high only if health risk or urgent.
